:expect-pins 5
# Generated full-source amendment-semantics pins for AS-06.
# Candidate source deltas are authored by the audit, never enacted by become.

# The original unregistered target label remains.
? adjust(Amend_Mint, Art_Mint).
# => TRUE

# The added registered target label is present.
? adjust(Amend_Mint, Art_Floor).
# => TRUE

# The added label alone marks the proposal false.
? false(Amend_Mint).
# => TRUE

# The prior passing label flips to blocked.
? become(Amend_Mint, Law).
# => FALSE

# No floor source effect accompanies the target-label change.
? entitled(Adam, event { eats() }).
# => TRUE
